[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=53 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="厨房门口排着一条不怎么直的队。有人拿碗，有人只拿一把勺子。帕金斯站到最后，发现自己排在一筐待洗的土豆后面，便问这筐算几个人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="要是它们也领一份，我下次出航带一车回来。劳力不够还能直接下锅，比我们好安排。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="别让炊事员听见，她会让你把这一车都削完。上次你说罐头最方便，后来开罐器坏了，还是你找人修的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你端着空碗走到窗口，里面的人先问你能不能吃辣。你说不知道，她没有觉得你在开玩笑，拿出一只小碟，分给你一点酱，让你先尝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="炊事员"

speaker_name=""

text="不知道就别整碗倒。今天只有这一锅，辣坏了不换新的。你旁边那位上次已经替自己领过一碗教训了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我以为瓶上写“微”，就照“微”来。后来才知道是个“危”，旁边还缺两个字。你们写字能不能别省地方，这不能全怪我。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿笑得把勺子碰到碗沿。你尝了一小口，先觉得咸，随后舌头开始发热。拉姆森满怀希望地看着你，等你替她证明那确实不是一般的辣。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我可以吃一点。先不加进汤里，放在这儿。你别再往我碟子里拨，我已经看见你的手了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我是在帮你把碟边擦干净。怎么现在连你也学会这么看人了，刚来的时候明明很客气。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻给大家找了一张靠门的桌子。门一开就冷，她仍把靠里那边让给潮痕。潮痕拿着碗没有坐，先问这个位置是不是有人固定用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="没有固定，今天先到先坐。要是门一开汤就凉，我们一起把桌子挪进去，不是让谁一直受着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我可以坐外面。衣服还没干，省得把里面的椅子弄湿。刚才有人说后面的洗衣绳已经满了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那就把椅子擦一下。我们都在海里泡过，不能每次谁湿一点，谁就负责坐最漏风的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们把桌子抬离门口，露出地上一个用粉笔画的方框。旁边的小字写着“修好这里”。帕金斯用脚试了一下，地板果然会往下陷。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="原来不是不知道怎么挪。先抬回来。弗莱彻，你下次做个决定以前，也跟普通人一样低头看一眼。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="看见了。我错。拉姆森，吃完有空吗？我们报修，不是让你现在放下碗。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="有空，但我要把这句话记下来。以免我刚咽下第一口，就有人问“你是不是已经吃完了”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕终于坐下，拿勺子在碗里慢慢拨。她吃到一块切得很整齐的萝卜，停了停，问这里是不是也有人喜欢把边角单独挑走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="炊事员"

speaker_name=""

text="边角炖得快，给晚回来的人留着。整块的先上桌，放久了也不容易烂。你们要是饿，后面还有，不用盯着这一块看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我只是记得有人说，切得一样大，就不会有人觉得自己分得少。我以前还信过，后来发现，谁端最后一锅才最要紧。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那今天我们能不能把剩下的送到值班室？他们还没换下来，回来以后大概又只剩碗底了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先问有几份。别让人以为大家都吃过，结果咱们把晚班那一份也端走。想帮忙之前，总得先知道已经有人在安排什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="炊事员递给你两只带盖的盒子，说她正要找人送。盒盖一只是圆的，一只是方的，拉姆森试了半天才发现拿反了，却坚持说是盒子设计得不讲道理。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你把会晃的都当成舰炮来装，当然装不进去。这里不需要左右对称，只要别把汤洒在值班表上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山进来的时候，你们已经吃到一半。她没有让人站起来，自己找了只碗。炊事员问她要不要看交接表，她说先给一份热的，表等吃完再看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="我在门口听见有人争谁去送饭。怎么争的？是都不愿意，还是每个人都觉得别人走一趟更合适？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我去。但我不知道值班室换到哪里了，所以还要有人带路。她们刚才在争，谁能少绕一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山说那就好，没有再接着问海上的事。她把一小块萝卜从汤里捞出来，吹了两次才吃。你忽然看见她手腕上也有被绳子勒过的痕，和你刚才擦手时看见的差不多。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我的证词什么时候交？我怕你们忙起来，回头又要重新找我。我今天都在港口，不会走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="吃完。值班办公室到夜里都有人，你去就报名字。不用在这里把事情再讲一遍，这桌上有人还在嚼。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕点了头，第一次没有因为话被按住而紧张。你把她差点推远的半碗汤挪回来，问她要不要尝一点酱，她看了拉姆森一眼，先把自己的碗护住了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="别听他们的。你只需要知道一件事，瓶上的字现在全了，下次谁再说看不懂，我就把盖子焊上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你提起饭盒，德雷顿跟着起身，说只是顺路。她手里没有要送的东西，走到门口才从桌边拿上那块写着报修的木牌。厨房里又开始讨论地板，谁也没把这顿饭叫作庆功。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="去值班室的路绕过晒衣架。德雷顿举着木牌走在你前面，经过一件破了袖口的外套时，忽然停下来，问那是不是你刚来那天穿过的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="好像是。我一直以为它已经不能穿了。那天脱下来时，口袋里全是砂，洗的时候还掉出一颗我不认识的扣子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="没扔，在修。你忘了也不怪你，我们这儿的东西一进公共洗衣间，就像重新出了一趟海，回来不一定还认得原来的主人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你在衣架上找到一块写着临时编号的布条。字是弗莱彻写的，缝得却歪歪扭扭。德雷顿看见你盯着针脚，抢先说不是自己缝的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="她说直线比绳结容易，结果拆了三遍。后来拉姆森让她别拆了，再拆下去，布上的洞比原来的还多。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那我是不是该装作没看见？她今天检查装备的时候很认真，要是知道我连她缝歪了都记下来，会不会很后悔把我捡回来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不至于。她只会把针线递给你，让你自己试一遍。到时候你就知道，嘴上说能做和手上做得出来，中间隔着多少个洞。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="值班室的门开着，里面的人接过饭盒，第一句话是问还有没有热水。德雷顿摸了摸盒盖，说锅里的不确定，但送饭的人这次没有走错路。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="值班员"

speaker_name=""

text="没错。再早一刻，我在隔壁搬电池，再晚一刻，汤又得先搁着。你们吃了没有？没吃可以坐这儿分，别让我待会儿再把空盒送回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="吃了。盒里一份不辣，一份把酱另放了。不是给你挑口味，是我们怕回来的人里也有一个看错瓶上那几个字的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

