[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="值班员笑着接过去，把两只空盒放到门边。你突然发现今天到过的每一个房间，都有一小块地方专门用来放等待归还的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我能不能借针线？外套上的布条，我想自己再缝一下。不是嫌现在的不好，是怕大家都记得它是谁的，只有我每次经过还要猜。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="回去找弗莱彻借。你自己跟她说，她会很高兴，虽然她多半只说一声“线别剪太短”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们回厨房交回空盒时，弗莱彻正在按住那块松动的地板，拉姆森蹲在旁边试尺寸。她见到你，先让你别踩红色粉笔线里面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_47"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我知道了。还有，针线能借我一下吗？想修一件外套，你的那件我也可以一起补，不过第一次可能会更歪。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_48"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="先拿自己的试。线别剪太短，留一点，不然最后打不了结。等我这边松手，就给你找。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_49"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿转过脸，肩膀抖了两下。你没拆穿她，只把吃饭时坐过的椅子搬来，让拉姆森放量尺。等地板修好，大家还得决定那张桌子究竟该摆在哪里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "tideborn"])

